WEBVTT

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:16.560
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:33.380
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.350
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.080
Pendulum Summon!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.800
Odd-Eyes, burn everything you see 
with your different-colored eyes!

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.470
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.030
He did it!

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:09.610
Yuya is now the world champion!

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:13.300
I did it!

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:18.860
Congratulations, Yuya!

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:21.000
Yuya!

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.900
You've emotionally touched 
the manly Gongenzaka!

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:29.260
How inexcusable, Yuya!

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:31.220
I did it, Dad.

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:37.660
My dueling has made so many people happy.

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:44.860
Dad...

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.660
Impressive as always, Master!

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:51.120
What are you doing?

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:52.930
You're incredible!

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:54.460
Be my master!

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.500
That's fine, right?

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.400
Right?

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.100
Hey, stop it!

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:11.330
It was a dream?

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:17.860
Being a champion was a dream.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.720
However...

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:23.660
Pendulum Summon isn't a dream.

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:26.700
I really did it.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.860
As long as I have Pendulum Summon...

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:38.270
I can duel to make even more people happy.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:43.100
Just like my dad!

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:50.300
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:58.390
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:02.390
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:21.170
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.580
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.320
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:37.890
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:40.090
Impulse  Got it got it

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:45.300
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:56.060
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:02.980
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:06.920
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:10.320
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:20.600
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.940
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:33.990
Aspiring Apprentice!?
Strange Admirer Sora Shiunin

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:38.290
What was up with that guy?

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:44.470
After he suddenly showed up and defeated 
Sawatari, he wanted to become my apprentice.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:50.280
En?  Core?

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.370
En!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.020
You've gained weight.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:58.540
When my mom found you, you were so tiny 
that you fit in the palm of my hand.

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:02.720
Good morning, Core!

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:08.590
I knew you were hungry.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:11.490
Eat as much as you like.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.730
Mom, you found another stray-

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:17.490
Hi, Master!

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.170
Why are you here?

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:25.390
He was wandering in front of our house.

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:29.920
Whenever I see someone who's 
hungry, I have to pick him up.

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:31.940
You're not allowed to pick up humans!

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:34.870
But isn't he your apprentice?

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:35.940
He's not!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.020
Whaaat?

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.390
No “whaaat!”

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:43.120
Sheesh.  Not only did you get into 
my house, but you also got breakfast.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:44.440
C'mon, it's fine.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:47.470
Your sister's pancakes are delicious.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:49.140
Sister?

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.940
You're not his sister?  I'm sorry.

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:57.790
Since you're so young and beautiful, 
I thought you were his sister.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.240
Oh my!

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:05.270
Young and beautiful?  How honest of you!

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:08.890
Since you like them, you 
can have more pancakes.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:10.350
Mom, those are mine!

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.720
Thank you, Sister!

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:13.390
Eat more!

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.090
Hooray!  Thanks for the meal!

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:17.540
Do you have maple syrup?

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:21.650
That boy...  Sora, was it?

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.680
So he's at your house?

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:28.820
Yeah.  I don't know how he found 
my house, but he barged right in.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:29.720
Master!

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.550
...is what he called me and...

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:33.580
Since when were you here?

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.520
Why are you following me?

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:39.280
Because I'm your apprentice, Master.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:42.150
I go wherever my master goes.

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:46.050
I told you many times that 
you're not my apprentice-

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.180
C'mon!  Let me be your apprentice!

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:51.220
Your duel electrified me!

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.120
Pendulum Summon is incredible!

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:55.050
I've never seen it before!

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:58.020
I want to try that too.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:02.520
Well, you can't Pendulum Summon 
without Pendulum Cards.

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:06.180
Then show me again.

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:08.320
Please please please!

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:10.720
Ask him for me too.

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:12.120
Why me?

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:16.020
Because he has to listen to his girlfriend.

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:16.880
Girlfriend?

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:18.420
You're not his girlfriend?

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:20.020
No!

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:23.150
Why would I date the female 
version of Strong ishijima?

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:28.180
How dare he say that!

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:30.080
Who does he think I am?

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:32.350
Master, are you okay?

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.910
As long as you have Pendulum 
Cards, anyone can do it?

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:43.180
Even Sawatari was able to do it.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.350
Pendulum Summon!

00:07:55.680 --> 00:08:00.460
I wonder why my master looks so serious.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.580
Master!

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:04.320
Master!

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.480
Master!

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:09.900
Master!

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:19.110
Yuya, you're still down in the dumps?

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:20.950
Because...

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:26.580
Don't look depressed when we get to school 
because our school is naturally depressing.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:30.780
Bright and fun entertainment 
dueling is your motto!

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:35.860
Oh yeah.  You're right.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:40.500
All right!  I'll flip the 
switch and change my attitude!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.680
That's the spirit!

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:47.780
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:52.180
The envoy of entertainment 
Yuya Sakaki has arrived-

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:54.580
Master!

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:57.680
You're even here?

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.180
Yuya, you're late.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.820
Yeah.  Your apprentice was waiting for you.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.280
But he's not...

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:10.550
Yuya, since he's your apprentice, that means 
he's enrolling in You Show School, right?

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:11.820
Right?

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:14.530
Like I said, he's not my apprentice!

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:17.280
Master, let's duel!

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:20.080
And show me Pendulum Summon!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.550
It's so awesome!

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:24.780
You bring out monsters with a bang!

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:27.820
I'm looking forward to dueling you, Master!

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:30.550
Why do I have to duel you?

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:33.280
What?  I can't?

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:39.780
Master, you're not going to duel me?

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:43.280
I feel bad for him, Yuya.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.650
Let him duel you.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:50.570
C'mon.  One duel is fine, right?

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:56.320
Yuya!  I don't recall teaching you to run 
away when you're challenged to a duel!

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.220
Master.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:03.380
Duel me.

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:07.280
Even with those eyes, no means no!

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:12.880
Fine, I'll duel you.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:13.980
Hooray!

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:14.860
However...

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:19.120
If I win, you can't hang around me anymore.

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:21.750
You'll stop calling me Master 
and won't be my apprentice!

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:22.550
Got it?

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:23.340
Yeah!

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:30.610
But if I win, I'll become your apprentice, 
call you Master and get to hang out with you.

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:47.380
Who will be the last one standing?

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:50.160
I'm really looking forward to this!

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:51.980
Action Field on!

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:55.880
The Field Spell The Wildest West!

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:11.220
Whaaat?

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:13.920
It's kind of lame.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:15.980
I don't like it.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:21.180
Isn't there a place that's more fun?

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:26.520
Umm...  How about this!

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:40.420
It's a land of snacks!  Looks delicious!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:44.680
I love this!  Thank you!

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.980
He's so adorable!

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:49.350
Sheesh...

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:08.020
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:11.250
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.920
...to move around the field!

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:17.680
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.590
Action!

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:20.720
Duel!

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:27.820
I go first!

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:31.400
I summon Performapal Hip Hippo from my hand!

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:38.780
Since I went first, I can't 
attack on my first turn.

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:41.570
I end my turn!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.920
My turn.  I draw.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:50.750
I activate the Continuous 
Spell Toy Vendor from my hand.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:13:00.490
Once per turn, Toy Vendor lets me send a card in 
my hand to the graveyard to draw a card from my deck.

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.460
I don't need this.

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:10.770
If I draw a Level 4-or-below 
monster, I can Special Summon it.

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:13.520
If not, I toss the card into the graveyard.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:14.670
I draw!

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:18.640
I drew Fluffal Bear!

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:26.750
I Special Summon Fluffal Bear!

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:33.120
Next, I summon Fluffal Leo from my hand!

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:43.580
By using his Continuous Spell's effect, 
he already brought out two monsters.

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:45.750
He's better than I expected.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:48.250
And both his monsters are...

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:50.810
Cute!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.380
What's up with them?

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.720
Yuya!

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:57.920
Look ahead!

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:09.620
Master, let's battle!

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:14.850
I attack Hip Hippo with Fluffal Leo!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.840
Just kidding.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:25.020
I activate the Action Spell 
Evasion from my hand!

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:29.110
This card negates one of 
your monster's attacks!

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:32.080
Rolling Hippo!

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:34.790
Dodging is cheating!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:38.080
It's not cheating in an Action Duel!

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:42.520
When did Yuya get an Action Card?

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:47.050
Maybe he got it when he fell 
into the lake of juice.

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:48.200
Correct!

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:49.220
Yuya!

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:50.870
Look ahead!

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:08.580
Next, I attack Hip Hippo with Fluffal Bear!

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:14.780
Is that an Action Card?

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:18.980
Did Yuya enter the cake because 
he knew it was inside?

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:23.050
I activate the Action Spell Candy Shower!

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:29.520
It's candy!

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:35.850
You're supposed to be attacking, not eating!

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:40.050
Candy Shower switches your 
monster to defense position.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.480
I end my turn.

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:46.980
I'll also get an Action Card!

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:50.220
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:55.980
C'mon, lift me higher!

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:05.580
I'll now get an Action Card.

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:13.480
I'm so lucky!

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.120
That's cheating!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:23.630
Since I acquired a good card, it's time 
I do what you've all been waiting for.

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.230
Can it be?

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:34.070
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:39.320
It's happening!

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:40.980
Pendulum Summon!

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:49.050
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:54.280
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:16:57.050 --> 00:17:01.720
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:09.510
Pendulum Summon!

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:12.820
Come out, my monsters!

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:17.550
Performapal Skeeter Skimmer!

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:20.780
Performapal Sword Fish!

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:24.090
And Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:30.660
This is incredible, Master!

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:33.820
No, the incredible is only getting started!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.640
I activate Sword Fish's effect!

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:43.480
Once per turn, this card lowers one of 
your monster's attack points by 600.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:52.820
I'll use the Action Card that I just got!

00:17:53.120 --> 00:18:00.030
Nanana raises my monster's attack 
points by 700 during this turn!

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:04.350
Nanana supports entertainment, 
so lend me your power!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:13.820
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
gains 700 attack points!

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:18.080
3200 attack points!

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.080
Awesome!

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:21.080
Let's battle!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:25.850
I attack Fluffal Leo with 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:29.750
Go, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:34.990
Burn everything you see with 
your different-colored eyes!

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:40.520
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:59.550
2200 points of big damage.

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:01.680
That fires me up!

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:03.950
It gives me shivers!

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:11.130
But doesn't Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon double 
the amount of damage the player takes?

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:15.450
That's only when it battles 
a Level 5-or-above monster.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:16.950
I see.

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:22.880
Fluffal Leo is Level 4, so the 
damage remains at 2200 points.

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:24.420
Exactly!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:27.050
I end my turn!

00:19:27.050 --> 00:19:33.880
Nanana's effect raised Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon's attack points, but they now return to normal.

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:40.780
Is he okay?

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:43.880
Yuya, maybe you're too fired up.

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:45.880
Yeah.  I feel bad for him!

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:48.720
But this is a duel!

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.480
This is what I wanted!

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:01.180
The monsters came out and did their thing!

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:03.950
Pendulum Monsters are the best!

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:07.950
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:16.650
Drawing this card means my 
deck wants to get serious.

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:21.200
What?  You haven't been taking 
this duel seriously so far?

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:24.450
You'll find out soon enough.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:29.640
I send one card in my hand to the graveyard 
to activate Toy Vendor's effect.

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:33.620
I wonder what I'll get?

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.050
This came out!

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:39.080
Level 3 Edge Imp Sabres!

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:48.550
I Special Summon Edge Imp Sabres!

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:54.150
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:56.600
What?  Polymerization?

00:20:56.600 --> 00:21:01.610
I fuse together Edge Imp 
Sabres and Fluffal Bear.

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:05.220
Devil's claws and beast's fangs!

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:10.020
Become one and show your new power and look!

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:12.280
Fusion Summon!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:14.750
What's this?

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.780
This is fusion.

00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:22.760
He combines his monsters to bring out a 
more powerful monster from his Extra Deck!

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:30.920
Appear, the hair-raising beast 
that slashes everything!

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:33.710
Frightfur Bear!

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:44.650
That's a Fusion Monster.

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:46.650
Yuzu, I'm scared!

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:47.920
It'll be fine.

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:49.420
Awesome!

00:21:49.420 --> 00:21:51.290
I've never seen it before either!

00:21:53.580 --> 00:22:00.150
Master, I'll show you what 
I'm like when I'm serious!

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:18.910
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:28.390
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.280 --> 00:22:40.400
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:45.640
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:51.080
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.330 --> 00:22:56.340
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.540 --> 00:23:01.940
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:06.360
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:12.330
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:17.740
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.740 --> 00:23:23.040
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:32.380
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:40.630
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.380 --> 00:23:47.980
Is that a Fusion Summon?

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:51.040
Whoa!  It ate Hip Hippo!

00:23:51.040 --> 00:23:55.150
It eats the destroyed monsters 
to increase its attack points!

00:23:55.150 --> 00:23:59.380
Oh my!  Master, what happened 
to your confidence?

00:23:59.980 --> 00:24:03.860
I have friends that will fight alongside me!

00:24:04.180 --> 00:24:09.920
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Innocent Toy
Frightfur Bear

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:12.520
The fun is only getting started!
